sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as Visitor phone (WAN)
  participant API as Flask REST API
  participant DB as Database
  participant WS as Socket.IO
  actor H as Host
  actor G as Guard phone (LAN)
  V->>API: POST /api/visitors/register (HTTPS, JSON)
  API->>DB: INSERT visitor + approval + qr_pass (token HASH only)
  API-->>V: 201 + QR image + access key
  API-)WS: visitor_registered
  WS-)H: push to room host:id
  H->>API: POST /api/approvals/id/decision
  API->>DB: UPDATE approval, visitor = APPROVED
  API-)WS: approval_updated
  WS-)V: push to room visitor:public_id
  G->>API: POST /api/qr/verify (token)
  API->>DB: SELECT pass by HMAC hash (no change)
  API-->>G: valid
  G->>API: POST /api/visitors/check-in (token, operation_id)
  API->>DB: UPDATE qr_passes SET consumed WHERE consumed IS NULL
  API->>DB: INSERT visit_log (gate, staff, time)
  API-->>G: 200 checked_in
  API-)WS: visitor_checked_in
  WS-)H: push (host room, admin room, security room)
